    "gitCommitHash": "4292e84bcb9e1ed6ac8f3b7f7c24e46badf69755",
    "gitCommitMessage": "Build 211 on both platforms, carrying the expo-asset pin\n\nAndroid is live on 210 and iOS on 209, so both move to 211 rather than one of them colliding with something already in the store. appVersionSource is local and autoIncrement is off, so these numbers are the ones that ship - nothing on EAS will bump them.\n\nThe payload is the expo-asset override. expo-asset@57.0.11 was hoisted over the 12.0.13 that expo@54 resolves, and its AssetModule.kt referenced classes absent from the APK, so Android died in native module registration before a line of JS. No OTA could reach it. .easignore keeps android/ and ios/ out of the upload so EAS prebuilds on Linux and autolinks with paths that exist there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UNs485E99owVv7bXP8upPo",
